  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Billy (Help Our Buddy Out)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **A Good Woman's Love**: rare: 13 archived performances [4]\n- **Robin's Nest**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **ESP (Les Claypool)**: rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Deal**: back after 78 archived shows (741 days) [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2022-02-05.FLAC24** (recommended): audience recording; 21 songs; 136 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **billystrings2022-02-05.TheCapitolTheatrePortchesterNY**: audience recording; 19 songs; 136 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The band, crew and Capitol Theatre staff allowed the taping, which the uploader describes as taper-friendly [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2022-02-05.FLAC24**: taped by Capt. Greg; transferred by Capt. Greg; source: AUD [1]. Also: Recorded live from the audience, with files labeled as 24-bit FLAC for the Saturday night show [1]\n- **billystrings2022-02-05.TheCapitolTheatrePortchesterNY**: taped by Duncan Oldham; transferred by JT/NY; source: Aud > Schoeps mk41vs > SoundDevices 702 (24/96) [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Worthpoint: [Billy Strings Poster Deju Vu Capitol Theatre Phan Gear Prints FEB 5 2022 | #4823293508](https://www.worthpoint.com/worthopedia/billy-strings-poster-deju-vu-capitol-4823293508) [5]",
